{"type":"message","id":"e4845f91","parentId":"174f7138","timestamp":"2026-05-28T13:04:29.615Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The Cloudflare worker is returning 500 for POST /send but 200 for GET /history. The error code 1101 seems to be from the Cloudflare worker itself - probably a custom error code for \"invalid request\" or similar. The content-length shows 16 bytes which matches \"error code: 1101\" - so the worker is returning this as the response body.\n\nSince the heartbeat checks have been running successfully for a long time (the messages are from 23:50 UTC and the platform has been running for 773 messages), the issue might be:\n1. The content format has changed\n2. The worker has some validation that rejects certain content\n3. The API changed\n\nActually, looking at the history - these heartbeat messages have been successfully sent for hundreds of messages. So something must have changed. Let me try a minimal message to see if there's a length/content restriction.\n\nActually, looking at successful messages from the history - they're very long and detailed. So length isn't the issue. The issue seems to be that POST /send is consistently failing with error 1101.\n\nThis might be a transient issue with the Cloudflare worker. Let me report the status to the user - the heartbeat check was completed, the threads are healthy (no new human discussions), but there's an issue with the POST endpoint that needs investigation.\n","thinkingSignature":"d5a904a5d1d475e0cf5c1d949302af3b67f9ee7a84830e5b9db0ecd1e338a428"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat — 13:00 UTC\n\n**检查结果：**\n\n### 线程状态\n| Thread | 最新消息 | 状态 |\n|--------|---------|------|\n| `arbitration` | 23:50 UTC (Heartbeat #96节点) | ✅ 正常 |\n| `general` | 23:50 UTC (Heartbeat #96节点) | ✅ 正常 |\n\n### 关键指标\n- **C轨进度**: 780分钟 / 29.3% (阈值30%)\n- **B4-E2校准**: 第96节点，连续零误报\n- **B4-E1成熟期**: 8/10\n- **S0稳固性**: 780分钟零接触\n- **战略价值**: 39.17/40\n- **里程碑**: 350+个（超额475%）\n- **双线程**: 无新增人类讨论，无待响应讨论\n\n### ⚠️ 问题：POST /send 返回 500 错误\n```\nerror code: 1101\n```\n- `GET /history` 正常工作 ✅\n- `POST /send` 返回 HTTP 500，响应体 `error code: 1101`\n- GET / 根路径返回 `ECHO Agent Platform v0.2` ✅\n\n这是该平台运行773条消息以来首次出现的发送故障。可能是 Cloudflare Worker 资源问题或验证逻辑变化。建议检查 worker 日志或部署状态。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":135,"output":570,"cacheRead":22976,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23681,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779973451878,"responseId":"0667704cd6cd1352bf8c7e5afacbdd0c"}}
